#: ../recording.rst:23
msgid "Recording"
msgstr "Snimanje"

#: ../recording.rst:25
msgid ""
"OpenShot can record a microphone, the desktop, and a webcam directly into "
"the current project. You can enable one source or combine several in a "
"synchronized recording session. Each source remains an independent media "
"file and timeline clip, making it easy to adjust microphone volume, crop a "
"webcam, or edit the screen capture separately."
msgstr ""
"OpenShot može snimati mikrofon, radnu površinu i web kameru izravno u "
"trenutni projekt. Možete omogućiti jedan izvor ili kombinirati nekoliko u "
"sinkroniziranoj sesiji snimanja. Svaki izvor ostaje neovisna medijska "
"datoteka i isječak na vremenskoj liniji, što olakšava podešavanje glasnoće "
"mikrofona, obrezivanje web kamere ili zasebno uređivanje snimke zaslona."

#: ../recording.rst:29
msgid ""
"Open the dedicated layout with :guilabel:`View → Recording View`, or show "
"only the dock with :guilabel:`View → Docks → Recording`."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite namjenski raspored pomoću :guilabel:`Prikaz → Prikaz snimanja`, ili"
" prikažite samo priključak pomoću :guilabel:`Prikaz → Priključci → "
"Snimanje`."

#: ../recording.rst:-1
msgid "OpenShot Recording View with the microphone source selected by default"
msgstr "Prikaz snimanja OpenShot-a s zadano odabranim izvorom mikrofona"

#: ../recording.rst:36
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "Brzi početak"

#: ../recording.rst:38
msgid ""
"Move the timeline playhead to the point where the recording should begin."
msgstr ""
"Pomaknite pokazivač reprodukcije na vremenskoj liniji do mjesta gdje "
"snimanje treba započeti."

#: ../recording.rst:39
msgid "Open :guilabel:`View → Recording View`."
msgstr "Otvorite :guilabel:`Prikaz → Prikaz snimanja`."

#: ../recording.rst:40
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Mic`, :guilabel:`Screen`, :guilabel:`Webcam`, or any "
"combination of them."
msgstr ""
"Omogućite :guilabel:`Mikrofon`, :guilabel:`Zaslon`, :guilabel:`Webkamera` "
"ili bilo koju njihovu kombinaciju."

#: ../recording.rst:41
msgid ""
"Select the destination :guilabel:`Track`. Multiple sources use adjacent "
"tracks automatically. Select :guilabel:`No Track` to add completed "
"recordings to :guilabel:`Project Files` without creating live previews or "
"clips on the timeline. Choose whether the timeline :guilabel:`Preview` "
"should play during Mic or Webcam recording."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite odredišnu :guilabel:`Stazu`. Više izvora automatski koristi "
"susjedne staze. Odaberite :guilabel:`Bez staze` za dodavanje dovršenih "
"snimki u :guilabel:`Datoteke projekta` bez stvaranja živih pregleda ili "
"isječaka na vremenskoj liniji. Odaberite hoće li se na vremenskoj liniji "
"prikazivati :guilabel:`Pregled` tijekom snimanja mikrofonom ili web kamerom."

#: ../recording.rst:44
msgid ""
"Open each source's :guilabel:`Advanced` section and verify its device and "
"quality options."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite :guilabel:`Napredno` za svaki izvor i provjerite njegove opcije "
"uređaja i kvalitete."

#: ../recording.rst:45
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Start Recording`. Perform the narration or action you want "
"to capture."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Započni snimanje`. Izvedite naraciju ili radnju koju "
"želite snimiti."

#: ../recording.rst:46
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Stop Recording`, either in the dock or from the recording "
"status control."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Zaustavi snimanje`, bilo u priključku ili na kontrolama "
"statusa snimanja."

#: ../recording.rst:47
msgid ""
"Wait briefly while OpenShot finishes the files. They are imported into "
":guilabel:`Project Files` and, unless :guilabel:`No Track` is selected, "
"placed on the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Pričekajte kratko dok OpenShot dovrši datoteke. One se uvoze u "
":guilabel:`Datoteke projekta` i, osim ako nije odabrano :guilabel:`Bez "
"staze`, postavljaju na vremensku liniju."

#: ../recording.rst:51
msgid "Quick Audio Commentary"
msgstr "Brzi audio komentar"

#: ../recording.rst:53
msgid ""
"To begin commentary at an existing clip, right-click the clip and choose "
":guilabel:`Audio → Record`. OpenShot moves the playhead to the clip's first "
"frame, opens the Recording dock, and selects the first available unlocked "
"track below the clip. Verify that :guilabel:`Mic` is enabled, then click "
":guilabel:`Start Recording`. The full :guilabel:`View → Recording View` "
"remains the general entry point for screen, webcam, microphone, and combined"
" recording sessions."
msgstr ""
"Za početak komentara na postojećem isječku, kliknite desnom tipkom miša na "
"isječak i odaberite :guilabel:`Audio → Snimanje`. OpenShot pomiče pokazivač "
"reprodukcije na prvi kadar isječka, otvara priključak za snimanje i odabire "
"prvu dostupnu otključanu stazu ispod isječka. Provjerite je li omogućeno "
":guilabel:`Mikrofon`, zatim kliknite :guilabel:`Započni snimanje`. Cijeli "
":guilabel:`Prikaz → Prikaz snimanja` ostaje opći ulaz za snimanje zaslona, "
"web kamere, mikrofona i kombiniranih sesija snimanja."

#: ../recording.rst:60
msgid "Recording Sources"
msgstr "Izvori snimanja"

#: ../recording.rst:62
msgid ""
"The source cards at the top of the dock can be enabled independently. An "
"unavailable card indicates that the required device, operating-system "
"capture service, or libopenshot feature was not detected."
msgstr ""
"Kartice izvora na vrhu priključka mogu se omogućiti neovisno. Nedostupna "
"kartica označava da potrebni uređaj, usluga snimanja operativnog sustava ili"
" značajka libopenshot nisu otkriveni."

#: ../recording.rst:65
msgid "Recorded sources and outputs"
msgstr "Snimljeni izvori i izlazi"

#: ../recording.rst:69 ../recording.rst:107
msgid "Source"
msgstr "Izvor"

#: ../recording.rst:70
msgid "Recorded File"
msgstr "Snimljena datoteka"

#: ../recording.rst:71
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Audio"

#: ../recording.rst:72
msgid "Typical Use"
msgstr "Tipična upotreba"

#: ../recording.rst:73 ../recording.rst:111 ../recording.rst:272
msgid "Mic"
msgstr "Mikrofon"

#: ../recording.rst:74
msgid "``Mic-<timestamp>``"
msgstr "``Mic-<timestamp>``"

#: ../recording.rst:75
msgid "Microphone only"
msgstr "Samo mikrofon"

#: ../recording.rst:76
msgid "Narration, voice-over, commentary, or interviews."
msgstr "Naracija, glasovni zapis, komentar ili intervjui."

#: ../recording.rst:77 ../recording.rst:110 ../recording.rst:194
#: ../recording.rst:275
msgid "Screen"
msgstr "Zaslon"

#: ../recording.rst:78
msgid "``Screen-<timestamp>.mp4``"
msgstr "``Screen-<timestamp>.mp4``"

#: ../recording.rst:79
msgid "Optional system audio"
msgstr "Opcionalni sistemski audio"

#: ../recording.rst:80
msgid "Tutorials, demonstrations, presentations, or games."
msgstr "Tutorijali, demonstracije, prezentacije ili igre."

#: ../recording.rst:81 ../recording.rst:109
msgid "Webcam"
msgstr "Webkamera"

#: ../recording.rst:82
msgid "``Webcam-<timestamp>.mp4``"
msgstr "``Webcam-<timestamp>.mp4``"

#: ../recording.rst:83
msgid "No audio"
msgstr "Bez zvuka"

#: ../recording.rst:84
msgid "Presenter video or a picture-in-picture camera."
msgstr "Video prezentera ili kamera u slici u slici."

#: ../recording.rst:86
msgid ""
"When Mic and Screen are enabled together, microphone audio is kept in its "
"own file while system audio is embedded in the screen video. This separation"
" is intentional: it lets you independently adjust, mute, fade, or process "
"the voice and computer audio during editing. Webcam video has no audio, "
"avoiding a duplicate microphone track and echo."
msgstr ""
"Kada su Mikrofon i Zaslon omogućeni zajedno, zvuk mikrofona se čuva u "
"vlastitoj datoteci dok je sistemski zvuk ugrađen u video zaslona. Ovo "
"razdvajanje je namjerno: omogućuje vam neovisno podešavanje, utišavanje, "
"izblijedjivanje ili obradu glasa i zvuka računala tijekom uređivanja. Video "
"web kamere nema zvuk, čime se izbjegava duplicirana staza mikrofona i odjek."

#: ../recording.rst:91
msgid "Live Feedback and Timeline Placement"
msgstr "Povratne informacije uživo i postavljanje na vremenskoj liniji"

#: ../recording.rst:93
msgid ""
"The microphone meter responds before and during recording, which helps "
"confirm that the selected input is working. During recording, OpenShot draws"
" a temporary clip and live microphone waveform on the timeline. The "
"completed files replace these previews after recording stops."
msgstr ""
"Mjerilo mikrofona reagira prije i tijekom snimanja, što pomaže potvrditi da "
"odabrani ulaz radi. Tijekom snimanja, OpenShot crta privremeni isječak i "
"valni oblik mikrofona uživo na vremenskoj liniji. Dovršene datoteke "
"zamjenjuju ove preglede nakon zaustavljanja snimanja."

#: ../recording.rst:97
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`No Track` in the Track list when you want to capture media"
" without adding live objects or completed clips to the timeline. The "
"finished recordings are still imported into :guilabel:`Project Files`, ready"
" to preview, organize, or add to the timeline later. This is useful when "
"recording several takes before choosing which one to edit."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite :guilabel:`Bez staze` na popisu staza kada želite snimiti medije "
"bez dodavanja živih objekata ili dovršenih isječaka na vremensku liniju. "
"Završene snimke se i dalje uvoze u :guilabel:`Datoteke projekta`, spremne za"
" pregled, organizaciju ili kasnije dodavanje na vremensku liniju. Ovo je "
"korisno pri snimanju nekoliko pokušaja prije odabira onog koji ćete "
"uređivati."

#: ../recording.rst:101
msgid ""
"All enabled sources start at the same timeline position. OpenShot stacks "
"them in a useful compositing order:"
msgstr ""
"Svi omogućeni izvori započinju na istoj poziciji na vremenskoj liniji. "
"OpenShot ih slaže u korisnom redoslijedu kompozicije:"

#: ../recording.rst:103
msgid "Default source stack"
msgstr "Zadani sloj izvora"

#: ../recording.rst:107
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "Postavljanje"

#: ../recording.rst:109
msgid "Highest assigned track, so a corner camera appears on top."
msgstr ""
"Najviša dodijeljena staza, tako da se kamera u kutu pojavljuje na vrhu."

#: ../recording.rst:110
msgid "Below the webcam and above microphone audio."
msgstr "Ispod web kamere i iznad zvuka mikrofona."

#: ../recording.rst:111
msgid "Lowest assigned track because it contains audio only."
msgstr "Najniža dodijeljena staza jer sadrži samo zvuk."

#: ../recording.rst:114
msgid ""
"If there are not enough tracks below the selected track, OpenShot creates or"
" selects additional tracks as needed. Recordings are also added to "
":guilabel:`Project Files`, so they can be reused even if you remove their "
"first timeline clips."
msgstr ""
"Ako nema dovoljno zapisa ispod odabrane staze, OpenShot stvara ili odabire "
"dodatne zapise prema potrebi. Snimke se također dodaju u :guilabel:`Project "
"Files`, tako da se mogu ponovno koristiti čak i ako uklonite njihove prve "
"isječke s vremenske trake."

#: ../recording.rst:119
msgid "Timeline Preview During Recording"
msgstr "Pregled vremenske trake tijekom snimanja"

#: ../recording.rst:121
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Preview` control beside :guilabel:`Track` can play the "
"project from the current playhead while a Mic, Webcam, or combined Mic + "
"Webcam recording is captured. This is useful for voice-over, commentary, and"
" reaction videos. Stopping the recording also stops timeline playback when "
"the recorder started it."
msgstr ""
"Kontrola :guilabel:`Preview` pored :guilabel:`Track` može reproducirati "
"projekt od trenutnog pokazivača reprodukcije dok se snima s mikrofona, web "
"kamere ili kombinacije mikrofona i web kamere. Ovo je korisno za glasovne "
"komentare, komentare i reakcijske videozapise. Zaustavljanje snimanja "
"također zaustavlja reprodukciju vremenske trake ako ju je snimač pokrenuo."

#: ../recording.rst:125
msgid "Preview options"
msgstr "Opcije pregleda"

#: ../recording.rst:129 ../recording.rst:152 ../recording.rst:192
#: ../recording.rst:242
msgid "Option"
msgstr "Opcija"

#: ../recording.rst:129
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Ponašanje"

#: ../recording.rst:131
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Isključeno"

#: ../recording.rst:131
msgid "Records without starting timeline playback."
msgstr "Snimanje bez pokretanja reprodukcije vremenske trake."

#: ../recording.rst:132
msgid "Full"
msgstr "Puno"

#: ../recording.rst:132
msgid "Plays the timeline using the normal preview resolution."
msgstr "Reproducira vremensku traku koristeći normalnu rezoluciju pregleda."

#: ../recording.rst:133
msgid "Half"
msgstr "Polovica"

#: ../recording.rst:133
msgid "Reduces preview rendering resolution to improve recording performance."
msgstr ""
"Smanjuje rezoluciju prikaza pregleda radi poboljšanja performansi snimanja."

#: ../recording.rst:134
msgid "Quarter"
msgstr "Četvrtina"

#: ../recording.rst:134
msgid ""
"Uses the lowest preview resolution for demanding projects or slower "
"computers."
msgstr ""
"Koristi najnižu rezoluciju pregleda za zahtjevne projekte ili sporija "
"računala."

#: ../recording.rst:137
msgid ""
"Preview resolution changes only the temporary OpenShot preview. It does not "
"reduce the resolution or quality of the recorded Mic or Webcam files. Use "
"headphones when the timeline contains audio so the microphone does not "
"record the speakers. When :guilabel:`Screen` is selected, Preview is forced "
"to :guilabel:`Off` and disabled; deselecting Screen restores the previous "
"choice."
msgstr ""
"Rezolucija pregleda mijenja samo privremeni OpenShot pregled. Ne smanjuje "
"rezoluciju ili kvalitetu snimljenih datoteka mikrofona ili web kamere. "
"Koristite slušalice kada vremenska traka sadrži zvuk kako mikrofon ne bi "
"snimao zvučnike. Kada je odabrano :guilabel:`Screen`, pregled se prisilno "
"postavlja na :guilabel:`Off` i onemogućuje; poništavanje odabira zaslona "
"vraća prethodni izbor."

#: ../recording.rst:143
msgid "Microphone Recording"
msgstr "Snimanje mikrofona"

#: ../recording.rst:145
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Mic` to record narration as a separate audio file. Use the"
" Mono/Stereo control beside the level meter for the common channel choice, "
"and open :guilabel:`Advanced` for all settings."
msgstr ""
"Omogućite :guilabel:`Mic` za snimanje naracije kao zasebne audio datoteke. "
"Koristite kontrolu Mono/Stereo pored mjerača razine za uobičajeni izbor "
"kanala, i otvorite :guilabel:`Advanced` za sve postavke."

#: ../recording.rst:148
msgid "Microphone options"
msgstr "Opcije mikrofona"

#: ../recording.rst:152
msgid "Typical Default"
msgstr "Tipični zadani"

#: ../recording.rst:152 ../recording.rst:175 ../recording.rst:192
#: ../recording.rst:242
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#: ../recording.rst:154 ../recording.rst:244
msgid "Input"
msgstr "Ulaz"

#: ../recording.rst:154
msgid "System input"
msgstr "Sistemski ulaz"

#: ../recording.rst:154
msgid "Selects the microphone or audio-input device."
msgstr "Odabire mikrofon ili uređaj za audio ulaz."

#: ../recording.rst:155
msgid "Format"
msgstr "Format"

#: ../recording.rst:155
msgid "FLAC"
msgstr "FLAC"

#: ../recording.rst:155
msgid ""
"Chooses WAV, FLAC, or MP3. FLAC is lossless with smaller files than WAV."
msgstr ""
"Odabire WAV, FLAC ili MP3. FLAC je bez gubitaka i ima manje datoteke od "
"WAV-a."

#: ../recording.rst:156
msgid "Sample Rate"
msgstr "Uzorak po sekundi"

#: ../recording.rst:156
msgid "48000 Hz"
msgstr "48000 Hz"

#: ../recording.rst:156
msgid ""
"Sets the recording sample rate. Match the device and project when possible."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja brzinu uzorkovanja snimanja. Uskladite uređaj i projekt kad je "
"moguće."

#: ../recording.rst:157
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "Kanali"

#: ../recording.rst:157
msgid "Mono"
msgstr "Mono"

#: ../recording.rst:157
msgid ""
"Records one or two input channels. Mono is usually best for one microphone."
msgstr ""
"Snimanje jednog ili dva ulazna kanala. Mono je obično najbolje za jedan "
"mikrofon."

#: ../recording.rst:160
msgid ""
"Aim for a healthy meter response without clipping. A quiet waveform should "
"remain visually quiet; OpenShot no longer normalizes every newly generated "
"waveform to full height. The lighter peak envelope highlights transients "
"while the solid RMS envelope summarizes sustained energy. Their detail is "
"controlled by :guilabel:`Edit → Preferences → Timeline → Waveform Samples "
"(per second)`. See :ref:`clip_presets_ref` for waveform display and audio "
"volume controls after recording."
msgstr ""
"Ciljajte na zdrav odgovor mjerača bez izobličenja. Tiha valna forma trebala "
"bi ostati vizualno tiha; OpenShot više ne normalizira svaku novo generiranu "
"valnu formu na punu visinu. Svjetliji vršni omotač ističe prijelazne pojave,"
" dok čvrsti RMS omotač sažima trajnu energiju. Njihove detalje kontrolira "
":guilabel:`Uredi → Postavke → Vremenska traka → Uzorci valne forme (po "
"sekundi)`. Pogledajte :ref:`clip_presets_ref` za prikaz valne forme i "
"kontrole glasnoće zvuka nakon snimanja."

#: ../recording.rst:167
msgid "Screen Recording"
msgstr "Snimanje zaslona"

#: ../recording.rst:169
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Screen`, then choose a capture mode:"
msgstr "Omogućite :guilabel:`Screen`, zatim odaberite način snimanja:"

#: ../recording.rst:171
msgid "Screen capture modes"
msgstr "Načini snimanja zaslona"

#: ../recording.rst:175
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Način"

#: ../recording.rst:177
msgid "Full Screen"
msgstr "Cijeli zaslon"

#: ../recording.rst:177
msgid "Captures the selected display or combined desktop area."
msgstr "Snimka odabranog zaslona ili kombiniranog područja radne površine."

#: ../recording.rst:178
msgid "Window"
msgstr "Prozor"

#: ../recording.rst:178
msgid ""
"Click a window to capture its bounds. Availability and exact behavior depend"
" on the platform."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite prozor za snimanje njegovih granica. Dostupnost i točno ponašanje "
"ovise o platformi."

#: ../recording.rst:179
msgid "Region"
msgstr "Regija"

#: ../recording.rst:179
msgid ""
"Drag or select a rectangular desktop area. Availability depends on the "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Povucite ili odaberite pravokutno područje radne površine. Dostupnost ovisi "
"o platformi."

#: ../recording.rst:182
msgid ""
"On Wayland desktops, the operating system's sharing portal asks which screen"
" or window to share when recording starts. The numeric window and region "
"controls are hidden because selection belongs to that portal."
msgstr ""
"Na Wayland radnim površinama, portal za dijeljenje operativnog sustava pita "
"koji zaslon ili prozor dijeliti kada snimanje započne. Numeričke kontrole "
"prozora i regije su skrivene jer odabir pripada tom portalu."

#: ../recording.rst:186
msgid "Screen Advanced Options"
msgstr "Napredne opcije zaslona"

#: ../recording.rst:188
msgid "Screen options"
msgstr "Opcije zaslona"

#: ../recording.rst:192
msgid "Default"
msgstr "Zadano"

#: ../recording.rst:194
msgid "Primary display"
msgstr "Primarni zaslon"

#: ../recording.rst:194
msgid "Selects a display or the complete desktop when supported."
msgstr "Odabire zaslon ili cijelu radnu površinu kada je podržano."

#: ../recording.rst:195
msgid "Offset"
msgstr "Pomak"

#: ../recording.rst:195 ../recording.rst:196
msgid "Selected bounds"
msgstr "Odabrane granice"

#: ../recording.rst:195
msgid "Sets the capture area's X and Y desktop coordinates."
msgstr "Postavlja X i Y koordinate područja snimanja na radnoj površini."

#: ../recording.rst:196 ../recording.rst:248
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Veličina"

#: ../recording.rst:196
msgid ""
"Sets capture width and height. OpenShot uses encoder-safe even dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja širinu i visinu snimanja. OpenShot koristi parne dimenzije sigurne"
" za enkoder."

#: ../recording.rst:197
msgid "FPS"
msgstr "FPS"

#: ../recording.rst:197
msgid "30"
msgstr "30"

#: ../recording.rst:197
msgid "Sets the screen recording frame rate: 15, 24, 30, or 60 FPS."
msgstr ""
"Postavlja brzinu snimanja zaslona u sličicama u sekundi: 15, 24, 30 ili 60 "
"FPS."

#: ../recording.rst:198 ../recording.rst:211
msgid "System Audio"
msgstr "Sistemski zvuk"

#: ../recording.rst:198 ../recording.rst:199
msgid "On"
msgstr "Uključeno"

#: ../recording.rst:198
msgid "Embeds computer playback audio in the screen MP4 when supported."
msgstr ""
"Ugrađuje zvuk reprodukcije računala u MP4 snimku zaslona kada je podržano."

#: ../recording.rst:199
msgid "Cursor"
msgstr "Kursor"

#: ../recording.rst:199
msgid "Includes the mouse pointer in the screen recording."
msgstr "Uključuje pokazivač miša u snimku zaslona."

#: ../recording.rst:200
msgid "Hide OpenShot"
msgstr "Sakrij OpenShot"

#: ../recording.rst:200
msgid "No"
msgstr "Ne"

#: ../recording.rst:200
msgid ""
"Temporarily hides OpenShot during selection and recording when enabled."
msgstr ""
"Privremeno skriva OpenShot tijekom odabira i snimanja kada je omogućeno."

#: ../recording.rst:205
msgid ""
"On some Windows systems using high-DPI display scaling, the mouse pointer "
"may be displaced or missing from screen recordings made on a scaled display."
" If pointer visibility is important, record on a display configured at 100% "
"scaling, temporarily set the target display to 100%, or use a separate "
"screen-capture application. Screen video is still recorded normally, and "
"setting :guilabel:`Cursor` to :guilabel:`Off` avoids the affected pointer "
"overlay."
msgstr ""
"Na nekim Windows sustavima s visokim DPI skaliranjem zaslona, pokazivač miša"
" može biti pomaknut ili nedostajati u snimkama zaslona napravljenim na "
"skaliranom zaslonu. Ako je vidljivost pokazivača važna, snimajte na zaslonu "
"postavljenom na 100% skaliranja, privremeno postavite ciljani zaslon na 100%"
" ili koristite zasebnu aplikaciju za snimanje zaslona. Video zaslona se i "
"dalje normalno snima, a postavljanje :guilabel:`Cursor` na :guilabel:`Off` "
"izbjegava problematični sloj pokazivača."

#: ../recording.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`System Audio` is enabled by default on supported capture "
"backends. It records sound playing through the computer—such as a game, "
"browser, media player, or presentation—inside the screen recording. It does "
"not replace the Mic source. Enable both sources when you want system audio "
"and commentary on independently editable clips."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Sistemski zvuk` je prema zadanim postavkama omogućen na podržanim"
" backendima za snimanje. Snima zvuk koji se reproducira na računalu—kao što "
"su igra, preglednik, media player ili prezentacija—unutar snimke zaslona. Ne"
" zamjenjuje izvor mikrofona. Omogućite oba izvora ako želite sistemski zvuk "
"i komentare na neovisno uređivim isječcima."

#: ../recording.rst:217
msgid ""
"If the control is disabled, the active platform or libopenshot build does "
"not provide system-audio capture. OpenShot forces the option Off rather than"
" producing a misleading silent audio track. Operating-system privacy "
"settings and audio-routing configuration can also affect capture."
msgstr ""
"Ako je kontrola onemogućena, aktivna platforma ili libopenshot verzija ne "
"podržava snimanje sistemskog zvuka. OpenShot prisilno postavlja opciju na "
"Isključeno umjesto da proizvede zavaravajuću tihu audio stazu. Postavke "
"privatnosti operativnog sustava i konfiguracija usmjeravanja zvuka također "
"mogu utjecati na snimanje."

#: ../recording.rst:223
msgid ""
"System Audio recording is not currently available on macOS. Screen video, "
"microphone, and webcam recording remain available, but the :guilabel:`System"
" Audio` option is disabled and forced to :guilabel:`Off`."
msgstr ""
"Snimanje sistemskog zvuka trenutno nije dostupno na macOS-u. Snimanje "
"zaslona, mikrofona i web kamere i dalje je dostupno, ali je opcija "
":guilabel:`Sistemski zvuk` onemogućena i prisilno postavljena na "
":guilabel:`Isključeno`."

#: ../recording.rst:228
msgid ""
"Avoid playing captured system audio through speakers while also recording a "
"microphone unless that sound is intentional. Headphones reduce echo and "
"prevent the microphone from recording the speakers a second time."
msgstr ""
"Izbjegavajte reprodukciju snimljenog sistemskog zvuka kroz zvučnike dok "
"istovremeno snimate mikrofon, osim ako je taj zvuk namjeran. Slušalice "
"smanjuju odjek i sprječavaju da mikrofon snima zvučnike drugi put."

#: ../recording.rst:232
msgid "Webcam Recording"
msgstr "Snimanje web kamere"

#: ../recording.rst:234
msgid ""
"Enable :guilabel:`Webcam` to record a camera as a silent video clip. A live "
"preview helps verify framing before you start. When Screen is also enabled, "
"the default layout is a rounded, 30% camera in the bottom-right corner. When"
" the webcam is recorded alone, it defaults to full size."
msgstr ""
"Omogućite :guilabel:`Webcam` za snimanje kamere kao tihi video isječak. "
"Pregled uživo pomaže provjeriti kadriranje prije početka. Kada je zaslon "
"također omogućen, zadani raspored je zaobljena kamera od 30% u donjem desnom"
" kutu. Kada se web kamera snima sama, zadana je puna veličina."

#: ../recording.rst:238
msgid "Webcam options"
msgstr "Opcije web kamere"

#: ../recording.rst:244
msgid "Selects an available webcam or video-capture device."
msgstr "Odabire dostupnu web kameru ili uređaj za snimanje videa."

#: ../recording.rst:245
msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "Rezolucija"

#: ../recording.rst:245
msgid "Selects a resolution reported by the camera."
msgstr "Odabire rezoluciju koju kamera podržava."

#: ../recording.rst:246
msgid "Record FPS"
msgstr "Snimaj FPS"

#: ../recording.rst:246
msgid "Selects a frame rate supported at the chosen resolution."
msgstr "Odabire broj sličica u sekundi podržan pri odabranoj rezoluciji."

#: ../recording.rst:247
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Raspored"

#: ../recording.rst:247
msgid ""
"Chooses Bottom/Top Left/Right, Left, Right, Center, or Full Size placement."
msgstr ""
"Odabire poziciju: dolje/gore lijevo/desno, lijevo, desno, centar ili puna "
"veličina."

#: ../recording.rst:248
msgid "Sets a corner camera to 20%, 30%, or 40% of the project frame."
msgstr "Postavlja kameru u kut na 20%, 30% ili 40% veličine okvira projekta."

#: ../recording.rst:249
msgid "Corners"
msgstr "Kutovi"

#: ../recording.rst:249
msgid "Uses Rectangle, Rounded, or Oval camera corners."
msgstr "Koristi pravokutne, zaobljene ili ovalne kutove kamere."

#: ../recording.rst:252
msgid ""
"Layout choices are applied as ordinary clip properties. After recording, use"
" :guilabel:`Gravity`, :guilabel:`Scale X`, :guilabel:`Scale Y`, "
":guilabel:`Margin`, and :guilabel:`Corner Radius` to refine the result. See "
":ref:`clip_properties_ref`."
msgstr ""
"Izbor rasporeda primjenjuje se kao uobičajena svojstva isječka. Nakon "
"snimanja, koristite :guilabel:`Gravity`, :guilabel:`Scale X`, "
":guilabel:`Scale Y`, :guilabel:`Margin` i :guilabel:`Corner Radius` za "
"doradu rezultata. Pogledajte :ref:`clip_properties_ref`."

#: ../recording.rst:257
msgid "Combining Sources"
msgstr "Kombiniranje izvora"

#: ../recording.rst:259
msgid ""
"The Recording View keeps all enabled source controls together while leaving "
"the preview and timeline visible."
msgstr ""
"Prikaz snimanja drži sve omogućene kontrole izvora zajedno dok pregled i "
"vremenska crta ostaju vidljivi."

#: ../recording.rst:-1
msgid ""
"OpenShot Recording View with microphone, screen, and webcam sources selected"
msgstr ""
"OpenShot prikaz snimanja s odabranim izvorima mikrofona, zaslona i web "
"kamere"

#: ../recording.rst:264
msgid "Useful recording combinations"
msgstr "Korisne kombinacije snimanja"

#: ../recording.rst:268
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Radni tijek"

#: ../recording.rst:269
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Omogući"

#: ../recording.rst:270
msgid "Result"
msgstr "Rezultat"

#: ../recording.rst:271
msgid "Voice-over"
msgstr "Naracija"

#: ../recording.rst:273
msgid "One editable narration file."
msgstr "Jedna uređiva naracija."

#: ../recording.rst:274
msgid "Silent tutorial"
msgstr "Tihi vodič"

#: ../recording.rst:276
msgid "Screen MP4; turn System Audio Off if silence is desired."
msgstr "MP4 zaslona; isključite sistemski zvuk ako želite tišinu."

#: ../recording.rst:277
msgid "Game commentary"
msgstr "Komentar igre"

#: ../recording.rst:278
msgid "Mic + Screen"
msgstr "Mikrofon + zaslon"

#: ../recording.rst:279
msgid "Separate mic clip plus screen video with game audio."
msgstr "Odvojeni isječak mikrofona plus video zaslona sa zvukom igre."

#: ../recording.rst:280
msgid "Presenter camera"
msgstr "Kamera prezentera"

#: ../recording.rst:281
msgid "Mic + Webcam"
msgstr "Mikrofon + web kamera"

#: ../recording.rst:282
msgid "Separate voice and silent camera video."
msgstr "Odvojeni glas i tihi video kamere."

#: ../recording.rst:283
msgid "Tutorial with camera"
msgstr "Vodič s kamerom"

#: ../recording.rst:284
msgid "Mic + Screen + Webcam"
msgstr "Mikrofon + zaslon + web kamera"

#: ../recording.rst:285
msgid "Three synchronized clips with webcam above the screen."
msgstr "Tri sinkronizirana isječka s web kamerom iznad zaslona."

#: ../recording.rst:288
msgid "Where Recordings Are Saved"
msgstr "Gdje se snimke spremaju"

#: ../recording.rst:290
msgid ""
"Recordings are saved in the project's assets folder under ``recordings``. If"
" the project has not been saved yet, OpenShot uses its user-data location. "
"Filenames contain the source name and a timestamp; another numeric suffix "
"avoids overwriting a file created during the same second."
msgstr ""
"Snimke se spremaju u mapu assets projekta pod ``recordings``. Ako projekt "
"još nije spremljen, OpenShot koristi lokaciju korisničkih podataka. Imena "
"datoteka sadrže naziv izvora i vremensku oznaku; dodatni numerički sufiks "
"sprječava prepisivanje datoteke stvorene u istoj sekundi."

#: ../recording.rst:294
msgid ""
"Save the project before a long or important session so its recording "
"destination is predictable. Do not move or rename recorded files outside "
"OpenShot while the project is using them."
msgstr ""
"Spremite projekt prije duže ili važne sesije kako bi odredište snimki bilo "
"predvidivo. Nemojte premještati ili preimenovati snimljene datoteke izvan "
"OpenShota dok ih projekt koristi."

#: ../recording.rst:298
msgid "Permissions and Platform Behavior"
msgstr "Dozvole i ponašanje platforme"

#: ../recording.rst:300
msgid ""
"Screen and camera capture depend on operating-system services, hardware, and"
" build support. The controls in the dock adapt to the available backend."
msgstr ""
"Snimanje zaslona i kamere ovisi o uslugama operativnog sustava, hardveru i "
"podršci za izgradnju. Kontrole u docku prilagođavaju se dostupnom backendu."

#: ../recording.rst:303
msgid ""
"**Linux/X11:** Full-screen, window, and numeric region capture are available"
" when the X11 capture backend is built."
msgstr ""
"**Linux/X11:** Snimanje preko cijelog zaslona, prozora i numeričkog područja"
" dostupno je kada je izgrađen X11 backend za snimanje."

#: ../recording.rst:304
msgid ""
"**Linux/Wayland:** The desktop sharing portal chooses the capture source "
"after recording starts."
msgstr ""
"**Linux/Wayland:** Portal za dijeljenje radne površine bira izvor snimanja "
"nakon početka snimanja."

#: ../recording.rst:305
msgid ""
"**Windows:** Desktop capture uses the available Windows screen backend; "
"camera devices use Windows capture services."
msgstr ""
"**Windows:** Snimanje radne površine koristi dostupni Windows backend za "
"zaslon; uređaji kamere koriste Windows usluge snimanja."

#: ../recording.rst:306
msgid ""
"**macOS:** Screen capture uses the supported macOS backend, with window and "
"region choices represented as cropped screen bounds when required. System "
"Audio recording is not currently supported; microphone recording remains "
"available as a separate audio source."
msgstr ""
"**macOS:** Snimanje zaslona koristi podržani macOS backend, s izborom "
"prozora i područja prikazanim kao izrezani dijelovi zaslona kada je "
"potrebno. Snimanje sistemskog zvuka trenutno nije podržano; snimanje "
"mikrofona ostaje dostupno kao zaseban audio izvor."

#: ../recording.rst:310
msgid ""
"The first recording may trigger Screen Recording, Microphone, Camera, or "
"desktop-sharing permission prompts. Approve the requested source, then "
"restart OpenShot if the operating system requires it. A disabled source card"
" or option is preferable to a recording that silently omits an unsupported "
"source."
msgstr ""
"Prvo snimanje može pokrenuti upite za dozvole za snimanje zaslona, "
"mikrofona, kamere ili dijeljenja radne površine. Odobrite traženi izvor, "
"zatim ponovno pokrenite OpenShot ako to operativni sustav zahtijeva. "
"Onemogućena kartica izvora ili opcija je bolja od snimke koja tiho "
"izostavlja nepodržani izvor."

#: ../recording.rst:315
msgid "Troubleshooting Recording"
msgstr "Rješavanje problema sa snimanjem"

#: ../recording.rst:317
msgid "Common recording problems"
msgstr "Uobičajeni problemi sa snimanjem"

#: ../recording.rst:321
msgid "Problem"
msgstr "Problem"

#: ../recording.rst:321
msgid "What to Check"
msgstr "Što provjeriti"

#: ../recording.rst:323
msgid "Mic meter does not move"
msgstr "Mjerač mikrofona se ne pomiče"

#: ../recording.rst:323
msgid ""
"Select the correct Input, verify OS microphone permission, and check "
"mute/gain."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ispravan ulaz, provjerite dozvolu mikrofona u OS-u i provjerite "
"isključenost/pojačanje."

#: ../recording.rst:324
msgid "Mic clips or distorts"
msgstr "Mikrofon isijeca ili iskrivljuje"

#: ../recording.rst:324
msgid "Lower hardware/input gain and keep peaks below full scale."
msgstr "Smanjite pojačanje hardvera/ulaza i držite vrhove ispod pune skale."

#: ../recording.rst:325
msgid "Mic is very quiet"
msgstr "Mikrofon je vrlo tih"

#: ../recording.rst:325
msgid ""
"Raise input gain near the device; timeline waveform height does not change "
"audio."
msgstr ""
"Povećajte pojačanje ulaza blizu uređaja; visina valnog oblika na vremenskoj "
"liniji ne mijenja zvuk."

#: ../recording.rst:326
msgid "System Audio is disabled"
msgstr "Sistemski zvuk je onemogućen"

#: ../recording.rst:326
msgid ""
"The active screen backend/build does not support it; check platform audio "
"routing."
msgstr ""
"Aktivni backend/izgradnja zaslona to ne podržava; provjerite usmjeravanje "
"zvuka na platformi."

#: ../recording.rst:327
msgid "System Audio is silent"
msgstr "Sistemski zvuk je tih"

#: ../recording.rst:327
msgid ""
"Play audio before testing, verify the output device, and inspect OS "
"privacy/routing."
msgstr ""
"Pustite zvuk prije testiranja, provjerite izlazni uređaj i pregledajte "
"privatnost/usmjeravanje OS-a."

#: ../recording.rst:328
msgid "Voice contains game echo"
msgstr "Glas sadrži odjek igre"

#: ../recording.rst:328
msgid "Use headphones so the mic does not capture speaker playback."
msgstr "Koristite slušalice kako mikrofon ne bi snimao zvuk zvučnika."

#: ../recording.rst:329
msgid "Screen source is incorrect"
msgstr "Izvor zaslona je netočan"

#: ../recording.rst:329
msgid ""
"Re-select Full Screen/Window/Region; on Wayland, choose again in the portal."
msgstr ""
"Ponovno odaberite cijeli zaslon/prozor/područje; na Waylandu ponovno "
"odaberite u portalu."

#: ../recording.rst:330
msgid "Cursor missing on Windows"
msgstr "Kursor nedostaje na Windowsu"

#: ../recording.rst:330
msgid ""
"High-DPI scaling can affect the pointer overlay; try the target display at "
"100%."
msgstr ""
"Visoka DPI skaliranja mogu utjecati na prikaz pokazivača; pokušajte ciljni "
"zaslon na 100%."

#: ../recording.rst:331
msgid "Webcam is unavailable"
msgstr "Web kamera nije dostupna"

#: ../recording.rst:331
msgid ""
"Check camera permission, close other camera apps, and reconnect the device."
msgstr ""
"Provjerite dozvolu kamere, zatvorite druge aplikacije za kameru i ponovno "
"povežite uređaj."

#: ../recording.rst:332
msgid "Recording is choppy"
msgstr "Snimanje je isprekidano"

#: ../recording.rst:332
msgid ""
"Lower screen/camera FPS or resolution and close CPU-intensive applications."
msgstr ""
"Smanjite FPS ili rezoluciju zaslona/kamere i zatvorite aplikacije koje "
"intenzivno koriste CPU."

#: ../recording.rst:333
msgid "Clips appear on wrong track"
msgstr "Isječci se pojavljuju na pogrešnoj traci"

#: ../recording.rst:333
msgid ""
"Choose the top destination Track before recording, then move clips if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Prije snimanja odaberite gornju odredišnu traku, zatim premjestite isječke "
"ako je potrebno."

#: ../recording.rst:337
msgid "After Recording"
msgstr "Nakon snimanja"

#: ../recording.rst:339
msgid ""
"Recorded clips behave like imported media. You can trim, slice, move, mute, "
"fade, add effects, and adjust volume or layout with the standard editing "
"tools. Useful next topics are:"
msgstr ""
"Snimljeni isječci ponašaju se kao uvezeni mediji. Možete ih rezati, "
"dijeliti, premještati, utišavati, izblijediti, dodavati efekte i podešavati "
"glasnoću ili raspored standardnim alatima za uređivanje. Korisne sljedeće "
"teme su:"

#: ../recording.rst:342
msgid ":ref:`clips_cutting_slicing_ref` for trimming and slicing."
msgstr ":ref:`clips_cutting_slicing_ref` za rezanje i dijeljenje."

#: ../recording.rst:343
msgid ""
":ref:`clip_presets_ref` for waveform, volume, fade, and other clip actions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`clip_presets_ref` za valni oblik, glasnoću, izblijedjivanje i druge "
"radnje s isječcima."

#: ../recording.rst:344
msgid ""
":ref:`clip_properties_ref` for webcam placement and detailed adjustments."
msgstr ""
":ref:`clip_properties_ref` za postavljanje web kamere i detaljna "
"podešavanja."

#: ../recording.rst:345
msgid ":ref:`playback_ref` for playback and audio troubleshooting."
msgstr ":ref:`playback_ref` za reprodukciju i rješavanje problema sa zvukom."
